The binary is a Rust program built by this repository's workflow from the
taplo-cli crate on crates.io, with upstream's default features and the exact
dependency versions in the crate's Cargo.lock. It statically includes those
crates under their own licences, listed with their licence texts in
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.

